{"name":"Greenella","hex":"#60857a","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Gutierrezia","blocks":[{"text":"Gutierrezia is a genus of flowering plants in the family Asteraceae, native to western North America and western South America. Plants of this genus are known generally as snakeweeds or matchweeds. Some species have been called greasewood. They are annual or perennial plants or subshrubs with yellow or white flowers."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/76/Gutierreziasarothrae.jpg/330px-Gutierreziasarothrae.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gutierrezia","wikidata":"Q2385155"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0b/Gutierrezia_microcephala_2.jpg/500px-Gutierrezia_microcephala_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0b/Gutierrezia_microcephala_2.jpg/1280px-Gutierrezia_microcephala_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0b/Gutierrezia_microcephala_2.jpg/500px-Gutierrezia_microcephala_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Flower heads of Gutierrezia microcephala","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGutierrezia_microcephala_2.jpg"}],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Grey rectangle","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Grey_rectangle.jpg/500px-Grey_rectangle.jpg","ratio":0.75,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Grey_rectangle.jpg","share":0.41375},{"title":"Gutierrezia sarothrae kz01","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Gutierrezia_sarothrae_kz01.jpg/500px-Gutierrezia_sarothrae_kz01.jpg","ratio":0.7142485699427977,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gutierrezia_saro